                    "en": "Add an append-only `Artifact` table (id, executionId, kind, schemaVersion, contentHash, content, producedBy, model, promptVersion, inputArtifactIds, createdAt). Add `contracts/events/*.schema.json` for RequirementApproved, PlanProduced, CodeChanged, ReviewCompleted, TestsGenerated. The Workflow API publishes events through the outbox when a new artifact is stored."
